   "url": "https://www.gao.gov/assets/720/719763.txt",
   "text": "We found that the strategy and the associated DOD plans included some, but not all characteristics that we look for in a comprehensive strategy. For example, DOD strategy does not include a full description of the resources and investments needed or the risks associated with the adoption of AI-enabled technologies. We recommended that DOD issue guidance to include all characteristics of a comprehensive strategy and future AI-related strategies, and to consider the key governance practices outlined in GAO's new AI Accountability Framework.",
